<!-- 01 · WHAT IS VAPT                                                    -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__aside">
        <p class="kicker">What Is VAPT</p>
        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing Services for Your Digital Infrastructure</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) is a cybersecurity testing process used to discover security vulnerabilities and determine how attackers could exploit them. A Vulnerability Assessment identifies and classifies potential weaknesses across applications and infrastructure, while Penetration Testing uses controlled attack techniques to validate the exploitability and impact of those vulnerabilities. VAPT is commonly performed for web applications, mobile applications, APIs, networks, servers, cloud environments and other internet-facing or business-critical systems.</p>
        <p class="rv">At CipherTrivia, a trusted VAPT testing company, we perform VAPT by first defining the testing scope and understanding the target environment. Our security team then conducts automated vulnerability scanning followed by manual security testing and controlled penetration testing to validate significant findings. We assess authentication, authorization, access controls, APIs, application logic, configurations and other relevant attack surfaces based on the agreed scope. AI-assisted security analysis supports vulnerability discovery and technical analysis while our security professionals validate the findings before they are reported.</p>
        <p class="rv">We offer VAPT service for various industries and sectors including businesses, enterprises, SaaS companies, startups, government organizations and technology teams that need to identify security risks in their digital systems. It is particularly valuable before launching a new application, after major application or infrastructure changes, during periodic security assessments and when organizations need security evidence for customer or compliance requirements. Our VAPT security testing produces findings with severity ratings, technical evidence and remediation recommendations, with optional retesting to verify that reported vulnerabilities have been addressed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="figure-wide rv">
      <div class="vflow" data-vflow>
        <div class="vflow__board" data-vflow-board role="img" aria-label="Animated VAPT workflow: findings from the vulnerability assessment are validated by manual penetration testing, classified by risk, written into the report, remediated and retested">
          <canvas class="vflow__canvas"></canvas>
          <ol class="vflow__stages">
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("target", "sm") }}<span>Scope &amp; Security Assessment Planning</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("radar", "sm") }}<span>Vulnerability Assessment</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("terminal", "sm") }}<span>Manual Penetration Testing</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("gauge", "sm") }}<span>Vulnerability Analysis &amp; Risk Classification</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("document", "sm") }}<span>Detailed VAPT Report</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("wrench", "sm") }}<span>Remediation Support</span></p></li>
            <li class="vflow__stage" data-vflow-stage><div class="vflow__zone" data-vflow-zone></div><p class="vflow__label">{{ icon("retest", "sm") }}<span>VAPT Retesting</span></p></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <button class="vflow__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause animation" data-vflow-toggle>
          <svg class="vflow__i-pause" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v10M11 3v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
