<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta">
        <p class="kicker">Scope of Work</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">What Is Included in Our VAPT Services?</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">At CipherTrivia, we provide Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) services to identify, validate and prioritize security vulnerabilities across web applications, mobile applications, APIs, networks and cloud environments. We combine automated vulnerability scanning with manual penetration testing to uncover exploitable security weaknesses and provide technical remediation guidance. Our VAPT security testing services follow industry-recognized practices with a strong focus on application security, infrastructure security and risk-based vulnerability assessment.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="subhead" style="margin-top:0">
      <p class="kicker subhead__label">12 Workstreams</p>
      <h3 class="t-h4 subhead__title">Our VAPT Security Testing Services Include:</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("browser") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Web Application VAPT</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We perform comprehensive web application penetration testing to identify vulnerabilities such as SQL injection, Cross-Site Scripting (XSS), broken access control, authentication flaws, session vulnerabilities, insecure configurations and other OWASP security risks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("mobile") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Mobile Application VAPT</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess Android and iOS applications for security weaknesses involving insecure data storage, weak authentication, improper session handling, API vulnerabilities, reverse engineering risks and insecure communication.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("api") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">API Security Testing</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We conduct API penetration testing to identify broken authentication, authorization issues, excessive data exposure, injection attacks, insecure endpoints and other vulnerabilities that can compromise API security.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("network") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Network VAPT</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our network vulnerability assessment and penetration testing covers servers, network devices, exposed ports, services and configurations to identify vulnerabilities that could provide unauthorized access to your infrastructure.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("server") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Infrastructure Security Testing</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess IT infrastructure for outdated software, exposed services, security misconfigurations and known vulnerabilities that could increase the attack surface of your organization.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("lock") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Authentication &amp; Authorization Testing</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test login mechanisms, password policies, session management, privilege escalation and role-based access controls to identify vulnerabilities that could allow unauthorized users to access restricted resources.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("bug") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">OWASP Vulnerability Testing</h4>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test applications against common OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities and related application security risks. Our testing focuses on identifying practical vulnerabilities that could affect confidentiality, integrity and availability.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("terminal") }}</div>
        <h4 class="ledger__title">Manual Penetration Testing</h4>
