<!-- 03 · PROCESS                                                         -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s3-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <p class="kicker">Methodology</p>
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s3-title">How Our VAPT Security Services Process Works</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">At CipherTrivia, our VAPT security services follow a structured security testing process that combines vulnerability assessment with manual penetration testing. We first understand your application or infrastructure scope and then identify security weaknesses through automated scanning and manual testing. Our security team validates exploitable vulnerabilities before documenting the findings with severity ratings and remediation recommendations. After fixes are implemented, we can perform VAPT retesting to verify the effectiveness of the remediation.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Scope &amp; Security Assessment Planning</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We define the testing scope, target applications, APIs, mobile platforms, IP addresses and infrastructure components. This helps us establish the VAPT testing methodology and assessment boundaries before security testing begins.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Vulnerability Assessment</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We conduct automated and manual vulnerability assessment testing to identify known vulnerabilities, insecure configurations, outdated components and potential attack vectors across the approved scope.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Manual Penetration Testing</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We manually validate identified vulnerabilities and perform controlled attack simulations to determine their actual security impact. This helps us identify vulnerabilities that automated scanners may not detect.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Vulnerability Analysis &amp; Risk Classification</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We analyze every validated finding and classify vulnerabilities based on severity and potential business impact. Critical and high-risk vulnerabilities receive higher remediation priority.</p>
