        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Detailed VAPT Report</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We prepare a comprehensive VAPT security report with technical findings, affected assets, vulnerability severity, evidence and recommended remediation steps. The report gives your technical team a clear view of the security risks identified during testing.</p>
