        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Remediation Support</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We work with your technical team by providing practical remediation guidance for identified security vulnerabilities. Our recommendations focus on addressing the root cause rather than only resolving the visible security issue.</p>
