        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">VAPT Retesting</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Once remediation is completed, we conduct VAPT retesting for applicable findings. We verify the implemented fixes and document the updated security status of the tested vulnerabilities.</p>
