          <details class="acc__item">
            <summary class="acc__q"><span class="acc__title">Does CipherTrivia provide VAPT retesting?</span><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="acc__a">Yes. After vulnerabilities are remediated, we can perform VAPT retesting to verify the implemented fixes. The retest results can be documented in a closure report for internal security teams and relevant stakeholders.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="acc__item">
            <summary class="acc__q"><span class="acc__title">How long does a VAPT assessment take?</span><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="acc__a">The duration depends on the scope and complexity of the environment being tested. Factors such as the number of applications, APIs, IP addresses, user roles and testing requirements can affect the overall VAPT assessment timeline.</p>
